0..76 Comment "//! An abandoned stack runs the unwind of each access it captured, innermost"
77..155 Comment "//! first, in place of the write-back it never reaches; its other frames never"
156..219 Comment "//! run. Each captured frame\'s destructor runs in reverse order"
220..300 Comment "//! [Congard-2025-linear_effects_exceptions_and_resource_safety]. An unwind that"
301..370 Comment "//! calls a declaration owed its body blames the run, which shows the"
371..394 Comment "//! abandonment ran it."
395..398 Comment "//!"
399..429 Comment "//! - see: #1334 — `unwound`"
430..503 Comment "//! - cites: [Congard-2025-linear_effects_exceptions_and_resource_safety]"
504..507 Comment "//!"
